<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Primadonna Resorts.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Primadonna Resorts.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- BT Securities Corp said it downgraded Primadonna Resorts Inc to market perform from buy.</p>
<p>-- cut the fiscal 1997 earnings estimate to $1.06 a share from $1.32 a share and the fiscal 1998 estimate to $1.17 a share from $1.40 a share.</p>
<p>-- Primadonna lost 3/8 to 19-7/8 in afternoon trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
